# ==============================================================================
# Bio-Repro Unified Pipeline Blueprint v1.0 — 16S Amplicon .gitignore
# 原则: 屏蔽大体积测序/参考库/中间对象与上游克隆 -> 放行各级 README 与轻量结果 -> 末尾屏蔽私人笔记
# ==============================================================================

# 1. OS / IDE / Language Runtime Artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/__MACOSX/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.Rproj.user
*.Rproj
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
Rplots.pdf

# 2. Large Raw & Processed 16S Bioinformatics Data
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.gz
*.fastq
*.fq
*.fasta
*.fa
*.qza
*.qzv
*.biom
*.nwk
*.tre
*.rds
*.RDS
*.RData
*.sqlite
*.db
data/raw/**
!data/raw/README.md
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/**
!data/processed/README.md
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/processed/smoke_*.tsv

# 3. Upstream Reference Clones & Local Run Logs
upstream_*/
logs/*.log
!logs/.gitkeep
!logs/sessionInfo.txt

# 4. Whitelist Reviewable Results & Documentation
!**/README.md
!repro_results/**/*.png
!repro_results/*.png
!repro_results/**/*.tsv
!repro_results/*.tsv
!repro_results/**/*.txt
!repro_results/*.txt
!repro_results/**/*.json
!repro_results/*.json

# 5. Private Interview / Resume / Showcase Notes (MUST Stay at Bottom to Win)
*/**/*[Ii][Nn][Tt][Ee][Rr][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]*.md
*/**/*面试*.md
*/**/*答辩*.md
*/**/*项目复盘*.md
*/**/*STAR*.md
*/**/*简历*.md
*/**/*话术*.md
*/**/*[Ss][Hh][Oo][Ww][Cc][Aa][Ss][Ee]*.md
